# Mobile Payment Banking System

## Description
A console-based Mobile Payment Banking System developed using Java. The application allows users to send money through mobile numbers, Bank/UPI IDs, and self-account transfers while maintaining account balance and transaction history.

## Technologies Used
- Java
- Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
- Collections Framework (ArrayList)

## Features
- Send money to Mobile Number
- Bank/UPI Payment
- Self Account Transfer
- Balance Checking
- Transaction History
- Input Validation

## OOP Concepts Used
- Interface
- Encapsulation
- Polymorphism
- Classes & Objects

## How to Run

Compile:

javac *.java

Run:

java PaymentSystemApp
